Start the server

Usage:
  app serve [flags]

Aliases:
  serve, s

Flags:
  -d, --debug         debug mode
  -h, --help          help for serve
      --host string   host to bind (default "localhost")
  -p, --port int      port to listen on (default 8080)

Global Flags:
  -c, --config string   config file
  -v, --verbose         verbose output
== app serve -h -> 0

